flowchart TD
    A([Start: BatchId + manifest]) --> B{watermark >= BatchId ?}
    B -- yes --> SK[Log Skipped] --> Z([End OK])
    B -- no --> C{watermark < BatchId - 1 ?}
    C -- yes --> FL[Fail: batch missing] --> ZF([End Failed])
    C -- no --> D[Clean this batch: staging, rejects, manifest]
    D --> E[Stage files - stage 1 validation]
    E --> R[Reconcile with manifest]
    R --> G[Load: agents, customers SCD, tickets, details, status, observations, assignments, breakdowns]
    G --> H[Recompute ticket lifecycle for the cutoff]
    H --> I[Log Succeeded with counts]
    I --> W[Advance watermark - LAST task]
    W --> Z
    E -. error .-> EH[OnError handler: log Failed]
    G -. error .-> EH
    EH --> ZF
